      "statementHash": "bc695b2cefde79fc6ae088255221d2aa76726fa411f82c7e16a50fdcb0351bf4",
      "summary": "Ongoing pelvic pain can fit endometriosis, but does not confirm it. Its timing, triggers and examination findings help frame the review.",
